cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "An Agent That Copies Nobody Is Certified as a Leader"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jacob
    given-names: Manu Nicholas
    email: manunicholasjacob@gmail.com
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
abstract: >-
  An audit of information-theoretic influence detection on real multi-agent chat. The conventional
  circular-shift surrogate is invalid on turn-ordered agent logs (family-wise error rate 0.90 against
  a nominal 0.05); a symbol-permutation surrogate restores it to 0.063, and a conditional estimate
  additionally removes common-cause edges.
keywords:
  - transfer entropy
  - multi-agent systems
  - AI safety
  - surrogate data
  - coordination detection
license: MIT
year: 2026
